1) 从告警标签取 domain，执行 whois \u003cdomain\u:
1) Take domain from the alert labels and run whois <domain> to compare the NS records, registrar, and registrant contact against expectations;
2) Confirm whether this was your own renewal, NS change, or registrar transfer by checking the change record;
3) If it was not, change the registrar password immediately, enable two-factor authentication, and check for pending transfer requests;
4) If a hijack is confirmed, contact the registrar at once to freeze the domain and enable the registrar lock (clientTransferProhibited).

1) 从告警标签取 domain，登录域名注册商控制台确认到期时间与续费状态；\:
1) Take domain from the alert labels and check the expiry date and renewal status in the registrar console;
2) Renew now and turn on auto-renewal, confirming the bound payment method has not expired;
3) Verify the registrant contact email is still valid; expiry notices going to an abandoned mailbox is the most common way domains are lost;
4) After renewing, wait for the whois data to refresh (usually a few hours) and confirm the alert clears itself.

1) 从告警标签取 domain，立刻登录注册商完成续费，不要等待自动续费；\n:
1) Take domain from the alert labels and renew immediately in the registrar console; do not wait for auto-renewal;
2) If auto-renewal failed, check the payment method, balance, and identity verification status, since any of the three will block the charge;
3) If the domain has been transferred out or you cannot log in to the registrar account, contact registrar support through their emergency channel right away;
4) After renewal, confirm the domain status returns from clientHold/pendingDelete to ok and verify resolution with dig <domain>.
